  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The first step involve the fridel craft alkylation reaction of benzene and cummene is formed as the product. That on oxidation with oxygen gas gives phenol and acetone.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0066_6c618076662b.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>Oxidation of phenol with strong oxidising agent will give benzoquinone(A). And bromination of phenol in non-polar medium will give ortho or para bromo&nbsp;phenol as major product.</p></blockquote>"
